On the twenty-first day of May in the year one thousand nine hundred [ILEGÍVEL] and six, I attach to these case records the documents which follow [ILEGÍVEL].
1. Reports from newspapers and magazines:
- Estado de Minas - 26 Mar 96 - Tuesday;
- Folha do Sul (TC) - 06 Abr 96 - Saturday;
- Sul de Minas - 03 Abr 96 - Wednesday;
- Sul de Minas - 04 Abr 96 - Thursday;
- Estado de Minas - 29 Mar 96 - Friday;
- Estado de Minas - 08 Mai 96 - Wednesday;
- Sul de Minas - 09 Mai 96 - Thursday;
- Sul de Minas - 10 Mai 96 - Friday;
- Estado de Minas - 11 Mai 96 - Saturday;
- Notícias Populares - 11 Mai 96 - Saturday;
- Estado de Minas - 13 Mai 96 - Monday;
- Folha do Sul - weekly edition of 12 to 18 Mai 96;
- “ISTO É” magazine - 22 Mai 96 - Wednesday.
2. Copy of the commitment note issued by EsSA in favor of the company AUTOMACO;
3. Copy of invoice No. 003788, issued [ILEGÍVEL] AUTOMACO, in favor of EsSA;
4. Copy of the Guard Unit's vehicle departure control forms;
5. Copy of BI nº 087, dated 10 Mai 96 - Appointment of the officer in charge of the inquiry.
